{"revision":"46a5a080a9c58ac0bca4880a2b00ce64abe85446aa97935088b2a2d8ef4b2d92","chapterRevision":"708f19c1a34bb1c1f4aa2e37445c9e3223ba90dac78f3a1351e70b90da87f27a","chapter":{"id":"special-sherlock-false-bottom","order":18,"title":"The Missing Motion, Part II","subtitle":"Every trophy has a story. This one rattles.","description":"A hallway recording and an evidence timeline lead to a false-bottom prop.","mapAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp","prerequisites":["special-sherlock-missing-motion"],"nodes":[{"id":"sherlock-prop-room-inventory","kind":"reward","title":"The Prop Room Inventory","mapPosition":{"x":7,"y":80},"prerequisites":[],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":100,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-prop-room-inventory:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":1,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-prop-room-inventory:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["Read every statement before advancing the investigation."],"focusMechanics":["story investigation"],"focusCards":["sherlock"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp"},"scenes":[{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"One film canister, one trophy plinth, seven fog machines. What ceremony needs this much plausible deniability?"},{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"There are eight fog machines. The extra one says NOT A HIDING PLACE in fresh marker."},{"speaker":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","text":"That label was a joke. Y’all never let a man have a suspicious sense of humor."},{"speaker":"Cornball","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/cornball.webp","text":"The trophy also rattles, but I assumed that was applause stored for later."}]},{"id":"sherlock-snitchs-exclusive","kind":"battle","battleType":"standard","title":"Snitch's Exclusive","mapPosition":{"x":30,"y":61},"prerequisites":["sherlock-prop-room-inventory"],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"currency","id":"street-xp","amount":125},{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":100,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-snitchs-exclusive:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":1,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-snitchs-exclusive:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["This testimony match lasts 5 rounds.","Hold the outside districts while preserving Motion."],"focusMechanics":["specific districts","Motion management"],"focusCards":["cornball","plug","hooper"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/03-promoters-back-office.webp"},"encounter":{"id":"sherlock-snitchs-exclusive","enemy":{"id":"sherlock-snitchs-exclusive:enemy","name":"Snitch","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/snitch.webp","deckId":"sherlock-snitchs-exclusive-deck","cardIds":["techbro","nerd","streamer","cornball","roaster","snow","plug","buspass","soulfood","cognac"],"behaviorProfile":"balanced"},"battlefieldAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/03-promoters-back-office.webp","cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/venues/harbor-skyline-court.webp"},"soundHooks":{"intro":"story.encounter.intro","play":"story.card.play","phase":"story.boss.phase","victory":"story.victory","defeat":"story.defeat"},"roundLimit":5,"modifiers":{"startingMotion":{"player":4,"cpu":0}},"phases":[],"starObjectives":[{"id":"win","description":"Win the encounter.","criterion":{"kind":"win"}},{"id":"outside","description":"Finish holding both outside districts.","criterion":{"kind":"specific-districts-held","owner":"player","lanes":[0,2]}},{"id":"motion","description":"Finish with at least 1 Motion.","criterion":{"kind":"motion-remaining","owner":"player","atLeast":1}}]},"preDialogue":[{"speaker":"Snitch","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/snitch.webp","text":"The full hallway feed is the prize on my stream’s next table. Beat me and I play it uncut. Yes, I monetized being useful."}],"postDialogue":[{"speaker":"Snitch","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/snitch.webp","text":"Fine. The feed shows Promoter carrying the plinth after the power-cut notice went up."},{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"You added thunder to an indoor hallway. Send the raw file before the weather develops a motive."}],"starObjectives":[{"id":"win","description":"Win the encounter.","criterion":{"kind":"win"}},{"id":"outside","description":"Finish holding both outside districts.","criterion":{"kind":"specific-districts-held","owner":"player","lanes":[0,2]}},{"id":"motion","description":"Finish with at least 1 Motion.","criterion":{"kind":"motion-remaining","owner":"player","atLeast":1}}],"recommendedCollection":["cornball","plug","hooper"],"battlefieldAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/03-promoters-back-office.webp"},{"id":"sherlock-evidence-order","kind":"reward","title":"Put the Evidence in Order","mapPosition":{"x":55,"y":44},"prerequisites":["sherlock-snitchs-exclusive"],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"currency","id":"street-xp","amount":125},{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":100,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-evidence-order:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":1,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-evidence-order:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["Read every statement before advancing the investigation."],"focusMechanics":["story investigation"],"focusCards":["sherlock"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp"},"scenes":[{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"Sequence before accusation. Arrange what happened, not what makes the best trailer."},{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"I have pinned the evidence low enough for everyone except the trophy to inspect it."}],"puzzle":{"id":"sherlock-missing-reel-sequence","title":"The Reel Timeline","instruction":"Order by actual time. Lobby clock and hallway camera are five minutes fast; courier and witness phones are correct. Use what the records show, not the order someone handed them over.","imageAssetId":"assets/story/puzzles/v2/sherlock-missing-reel-sequence.webp","pieces":[{"id":"hallway-frame","label":"Hallway frame","detail":"18:07, hallway camera: Promoter carries the rattling plinth. Camera is five minutes fast."},{"id":"power-notice","label":"Power-cut notice","detail":"18:00, lobby clock: power notice posted. The lobby clock is five minutes fast."},{"id":"leader-strip","label":"Film leader strip","detail":"18:04, synchronized phone: film leader protrudes from the plinth’s loose bottom panel."},{"id":"empty-case","label":"Empty case receipt","detail":"17:58, synchronized courier phone: empty case delivered to the now-open prop room. Photo shows its empty interior."}],"solution":["power-notice","empty-case","hallway-frame","leader-strip"],"hints":["Correct both fast clocks by subtracting five minutes.","The four actual times are 17:55, 17:58, 18:02, 18:04."],"solvedText":"The empty case arrived before Promoter carried the rattling plinth. Film protruding from its bottom identifies the hiding place; the timestamps alone do not.","skipText":"Sherlock orders the timestamps himself. The trail still leads to the trophy plinth."}},{"id":"sherlock-false-bottom-fade","kind":"battle","battleType":"mini-boss","title":"The False-Bottom Fade","mapPosition":{"x":78,"y":25},"prerequisites":["sherlock-evidence-order"],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"currency","id":"street-xp","amount":150},{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":200,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-false-bottom-fade:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":1,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-false-bottom-fade:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["This testimony match lasts 6 rounds.","Hold the outside districts while preserving Motion."],"focusMechanics":["specific districts","Motion management"],"focusCards":["cornball","plug","hooper"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp"},"encounter":{"id":"sherlock-false-bottom-fade","enemy":{"id":"sherlock-false-bottom-fade:enemy","name":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","deckId":"sherlock-false-bottom-fade-deck","cardIds":["techbro","nerd","streamer","cornball","roaster","snow","plug","buspass","soulfood","cognac"],"behaviorProfile":"balanced"},"battlefieldAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp","cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/venues/crown-rooftop-court.webp"},"soundHooks":{"intro":"story.encounter.intro","play":"story.card.play","phase":"story.boss.phase","victory":"story.victory","defeat":"story.defeat"},"roundLimit":6,"modifiers":{"startingMotion":{"player":4,"cpu":1}},"phases":[],"starObjectives":[{"id":"win","description":"Win the encounter.","criterion":{"kind":"win"}},{"id":"outside","description":"Finish holding both outside districts.","criterion":{"kind":"specific-districts-held","owner":"player","lanes":[0,2]}},{"id":"motion","description":"Finish with at least 1 Motion.","criterion":{"kind":"motion-remaining","owner":"player","atLeast":1}}]},"preDialogue":[{"speaker":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","text":"Before anybody opens that trophy, I request one dignified match and no close-ups."},{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"The trophy has already requested the opposite by rattling during your sentence."}],"postDialogue":[{"speaker":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","text":"The false bottom is mine. The reel is safe inside, wrapped in the schedule I was correcting."},{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"Safe is not the same as returned. We still require the reason."}],"starObjectives":[{"id":"win","description":"Win the encounter.","criterion":{"kind":"win"}},{"id":"outside","description":"Finish holding both outside districts.","criterion":{"kind":"specific-districts-held","owner":"player","lanes":[0,2]}},{"id":"motion","description":"Finish with at least 1 Motion.","criterion":{"kind":"motion-remaining","owner":"player","atLeast":1}}],"recommendedCollection":["cornball","plug","hooper"],"battlefieldAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp"},{"id":"sherlock-reel-in-the-trophy","kind":"reward","title":"The Reel in the Trophy","mapPosition":{"x":94,"y":9},"prerequisites":["sherlock-false-bottom-fade"],"optional":false,"rewards":[{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":2},{"kind":"currency","id":"clout","amount":250,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-reel-in-the-trophy:clout"},{"kind":"pack-ticket","id":"street-pack-ticket","amount":8,"claimKey":"story-payout-contract:v1:sherlock-reel-in-the-trophy:ticket"}],"teaching":{"tips":["Read every statement before advancing the investigation."],"focusMechanics":["story investigation"],"focusCards":["sherlock"]},"cinematic":{"videoAssetId":"assets/story/chapter-one/media/standard-clash.mp4","posterAssetId":"assets/story/theater/sherlock.webp","environmentAssetId":"assets/story/environments/backgrounds/02-bootleg-film-archive.webp"},"scenes":[{"speaker":"Cornball","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/cornball.webp","text":"The trophy contained no applause. It did contain one reel and a shocking amount of tape."},{"speaker":"Sherlock","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/sherlock.webp","text":"Fresh blue carbon on the false panel matches Promoter’s clipboard. The hiding place and its maker agree."},{"speaker":"Promoter","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/promoter.webp","text":"I borrowed it. I planned to fix one title card and put it back before the lights returned."},{"speaker":"Alice","portraitAssetId":"assets/characters/alice.webp","text":"A confession with an intermission. Save the motive for the final reel."}]}]}}
